{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Adding_Rectangular_Areas)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Adding Rectangular Areas)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Subtracting_Rectangular_Areas)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Subtracting Rectangular Areas)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Trapezoids)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Trapezoids)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of polygon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />, in square units, is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d6759f0de5700e70214c4070dda57fd791c62ae8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 46 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 66 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a41b89f4f50edbafedb2363591428f6c617d5ebb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,9)--(6,9)--(6,0)--(2,0)--(2,4)--(0,4)--cycle); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0,9),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,(6,9),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;D&quot;,(2,0),SW); label(&quot;E&quot;,(2,4),NE); label(&quot;F&quot;,(0,4),SW); label(&quot;6&quot;,(3,9),N); label(&quot;9&quot;,(6,4.5),E); label(&quot;4&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;5&quot;,(0,6.5),W); [/asy]\" width=\"182\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Adding_Rectangular_Areas.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Adding_Rectangular_Areas)\">Solution 1 (Adding Rectangular Areas)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Adding Rectangular Areas)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53d42af3a295af11680304699ec18869ca7b5d24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,9)--(6,9)--(6,0)--(2,0)--(2,4)--(0,4)--cycle); draw((2,4)--(6,4),dashed); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0,9),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,(6,9),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;D&quot;,(2,0),SW); label(&quot;E&quot;,(2,4),NE); label(&quot;F&quot;,(0,4),SW); label(&quot;G&quot;,(6,4),E); label(&quot;6&quot;,(3,9),N); label(&quot;5&quot;,(6,6.5),E); label(&quot;4&quot;,(6,2),E); label(&quot;4&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;5&quot;,(0,6.5),W); [/asy]\" width=\"185\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a0789bd57f33e9ba6593c23331278e1f022b7739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{FE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> to meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> into rectangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/38349a1c311242d250dd171488a43965cdc56d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABGF$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adbc220306dd3c7a7350807bf89154207d671715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EGCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5d1c9bd020d660c1afedf82721c993ab5c47c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BG = AF = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41ce9315f48592091b9e1dca9c979fe375358a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GC = 9 - 5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/38349a1c311242d250dd171488a43965cdc56d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABGF$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/171948e34a4fd62d00a56a97fcd05faf44ff750e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 5 = 30$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adbc220306dd3c7a7350807bf89154207d671715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EGCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/6/c0637a8a49dd1bc93c7ea16d0b1d22c26f9714e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\cdot 4 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />.  Therefore, the total area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/564fd0290601071963d57e13e8734a5bfd1bbc61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 + 16 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Subtracting_Rectangular_Areas.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Subtracting_Rectangular_Areas)\">Solution 2 (Subtracting Rectangular Areas)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Subtracting Rectangular Areas)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/7/ca7e9186820dca1768c1e283ab4278219a40bad1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,9)--(6,9)--(6,0)--(2,0)--(2,4)--(0,4)--cycle); draw((0,4)--(0,0),dashed); draw((0,0)--(2,0),dashed); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0,9),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,(6,9),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;D&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;E&quot;,(2,4),NE); label(&quot;F&quot;,(0,4),W); label(&quot;G&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;6&quot;,(3,9),N); label(&quot;9&quot;,(6,4.5),E); label(&quot;4&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;2&quot;,(1,0),S); label(&quot;4&quot;,(0,2),W); label(&quot;5&quot;,(0,6.5),W); [/asy]\" width=\"182\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c65a0b904f8f63efdc2b5abfef3f4f05b2d3f990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AF}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> to meet at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac5310f001b30761da672aa0b552b63cb7bbe8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG = 9 - 5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7ed2473dc30110219e4636b3026ca117c924952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GD = 6 - 4 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is the difference between the area of rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46f1220f7a8b3ae19b81250e19b49cc1e84e2e3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> and the area of rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504323bcf8b4c46a69548917d2a9872533874436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FEDG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46f1220f7a8b3ae19b81250e19b49cc1e84e2e3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/4/4449216931440b0b4513fc01a68f48bd3d0d9c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 9 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, while the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504323bcf8b4c46a69548917d2a9872533874436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FEDG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7a1f54e5eb742563df52e8d0f8a4ee122b4d03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\cdot 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" />, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c00fc59058001b17b33fe9f3553df34d117a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Trapezoids.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Trapezoids)\">Solution 3 (Trapezoids)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Trapezoids)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15ff99e9604421b8402e716507a5afb12d6b3dc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,9)--(6,9)--(6,0)--(2,0)--(2,4)--(0,4)--cycle); draw((2,4)--(6,9),dashed); label(&quot;A&quot;,(0,9),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,(6,9),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;D&quot;,(2,0),SW); label(&quot;E&quot;,(2,4),SE); label(&quot;F&quot;,(0,4),SW); label(&quot;6&quot;,(3,9),N); label(&quot;9&quot;,(6,4.5),E); label(&quot;4&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;2&quot;,(1,4),S); label(&quot;4&quot;,(2,2),W); label(&quot;5&quot;,(0,6.5),W); [/asy]\" width=\"182\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>First, notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d4b50447b17626e137257c84b8b751305bd351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FE = 6 - 4 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca9282ad236e0f9dea5151786a714e56c2f79880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ED = 9 - 5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>Draw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> into trapezoids <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e91fa584790bd73c21e57d1c0bdc5199237b961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABEF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65af420a6e2b903f5295dd8f65f321545f69e44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCDE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />.  Then the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a14004646274cf882587050d18bc52fa860ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABEF = \\frac{5(6+2)}{2} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" /> and the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65af420a6e2b903f5295dd8f65f321545f69e44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCDE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/11271bbc7262683ff2aa120bbd2283b7864bea7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4(4+9)}{2} = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" />, so the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2465903fe85b854515111cc60bb22f97f16701a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20+26=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~ edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-_r5GzafCUY\">https://youtu.be/-_r5GzafCUY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9OHRebmMyz4\">https://youtu.be/9OHRebmMyz4</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\